OL,3,GNEWSA'People are suffering in silence
OL,4,Afrom hidden crime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims of loan sharks are being
OL,7,Fencouraged to stop suffering in
OL,8,Fsilence.
OL,10,FLoan sharks are illegal moneylenders
OL,11,Fwho often charge very high interest
OL,12,Frates, which can then lead to
OL,13,Fintimidation and violence towards
OL,14,Fvictims. More than 1.7 million people
OL,15,Fare in debt to perpetrators across
OL,16,FEngland, according to The Centre for
OL,17,FSocial Justice.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
