OL,3,GNEWSA'People are suffering in silence
OL,4,Afrom hidden crime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 organisations - including
OL,7,FPriorswood Community Centre in Taunton
OL,8,F- have signed up to act as new support
OL,9,Fpoints across the country to allow
OL,10,Fpeople to seek help in person, rather
OL,11,Fthan via an anonymous phone line.
OL,13,FCatherine Wohlers, operation manager at
OL,14,Fthe England Illegal Money Lending team,
OL,15,Fsaid the issue is "such a hidden and
OL,16,Funder-reported crime".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
